Package: CPR
Type: Package
Title: Cointegrating Polynomial Regressions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("CPR-R", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "astadamo18@gmail.com")
Description: Estimation and inference for cointegrating polynomial regressions
    (CPR), following Wagner and co-authors (e.g. Wagner; Wagner & Reichold;
    de Jong & Wagner; Veldhuis & Wagner). Provides a fully modified OLS
    (FM-OLS) estimator for a single cointegrating polynomial regression, with
    a choice of kernels and bandwidth selectors for long-run variance
    estimation, and an extensible interface for adding further estimators
    (DOLS, MOLS, IMOLS) and a panel version later on.
